{"id":229,"flavor":[{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Identifiable by its eerie howls, people a long time ago thought it was the grim reaper and feared it."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"They spew flames mixed with poison to finish off their opponents. They divvy up their prey evenly among the members of their pack."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby"],"text":"In a Houndoom pack, the one with its horns raked sharply toward the back serves a leadership role. These Pokémon choose their leader by fighting among themselves."},{"games":["Y","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"The flames it breathes when angry contain toxins. If they cause a burn, it will hurt forever."},{"games":["X","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"Long ago, people imagined its eerie howls to be the call of the grim reaper."},{"games":["SoulSilver","FireRed","Silver"],"text":"Upon hearing its eerie howls, other Pokémon get the shivers and head straight back to their nests."},{"games":["HeartGold","LeafGreen","Gold"],"text":"If you are burned by the flames it shoots from its mouth, the pain will never go away."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"In a HOUNDOOM pack, the one with its horns raked sharply back serves a leadership role. They choose their leader by fighting among themselves."},{"games":["Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"In a HOUNDOOM pack, the one with its horns raked sharply towards the back serves a leadership role. These POKéMON choose their leader by fighting amongst themselves."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"The pungent- smelling flame that shoots from its mouth results from toxins burning in its body."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Early Bird","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon awakens from sleep twice as fast as other Pokémon."},{"name":"Flash Fire","hidden":false,"description":"If hit by a Fire-type move, the Pokémon absorbs the flames and uses them to power up its own Fire-type moves."},{"name":"Unnerve","hidden":true,"description":"Unnerves opposing Pokémon and makes them unable to eat Berries."}],"eggGroups":["Field"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":35,"growthRate":"slow","habitat":"rough terrain","color":"Black","shape":"Quadruped","evolution":{"id":228,"name":"Houndour","condition":null,"children":[{"id":229,"name":"Houndoom","condition":"Lv. 24","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,43],[1,52],[1,123],[1,336],[1,417],[1,422],[13,46],[16,44],[20,510],[26,251],[30,424],[35,259],[41,894],[45,492],[50,53],[56,242],[62,517]],"machine":[34,807,242,399,38,283,203,263,126,424,83,488,53,394,492,416,257,270,63,304,808,341,189,417,315,220,182,706,240,156,179,46,184,247,214,188,555,76,180,164,241,162,36,269,915,851,168,675,422,92,885,261],"egg":[],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"sv10-191","name":"Team Rocket's Houndoom","set":"Destined Rivals","date":"2025-05-30","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"191","artist":null,"img":"sv10/191"},{"id":"sv10-38","name":"Team Rocket's Houndoom","set":"Destined Rivals","date":"2025-05-30","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"38","artist":null,"img":"sv10/38"},{"id":"sv8pt5-63","name":"Houndoom","set":"Prismatic Evolutions","date":"2025-01-17","rarity":"Common","number":"63","artist":null,"img":"sv8pt5/63"},{"id":"sv6pt5-8","name":"Houndoom","set":"Shrouded Fable","date":"2024-08-02","rarity":"Common","number":"8","artist":"burari","img":"sv6pt5/8"},{"id":"sv6pt5-66","name":"Houndoom","set":"Shrouded Fable","date":"2024-08-02","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"66","artist":"Taiga Kasai","img":"sv6pt5/66"},{"id":"sv3-133","name":"Houndoom","set":"Obsidian Flames","date":"2023-08-11","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"133","artist":"Haru Akasaka","img":"sv3/133"},{"id":"sv3-134","name":"Houndoom ex","set":"Obsidian Flames","date":"2023-08-11","rarity":"Double Rare","number":"134","artist":"PLANETA Tsuji","img":"sv3/134"},{"id":"sv1-34","name":"Houndoom","set":"Scarlet & Violet","date":"2023-03-31","rarity":"Common","number":"34","artist":"hncl","img":"sv1/34"},{"id":"svp-103"